// SR 514.51 — Chapter 2 Prohibited War Materiel
// generated by src/parse.py. Do not edit by hand.

:NOTE
Amended by No I of the FA of 16 March 2012, in force since 1 Feb. 2013 (AS 2013 295; BBl 2011 5905).
